xt-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"See exactly how the One Big Beautiful Bill Act (OBBBA) changes your 2026 tax refund. New SALT cap, doubled Child Tax Credit, tip/overtime deductions, and worked examples comparing OBBBA vs prior law.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground border-b border-border/30 pb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"By \",\"Rachel Mitchell\",\", \",\"CPA\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"time\",null,{\"dateTime\":\"2026-07-04T20:50:00.000Z\",\"children\":\"July 4, 2026\"}]}],false,[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[10,\" min read\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"OBBBA 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"OBBBA 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"One Big Beautiful Bill Act\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"One Big Beautiful Bill Act\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"OBBBA tax refund\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"OBBBA tax refund\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"OBBBA tax calculator\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"OBBBA tax calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"SALT cap 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"SALT cap 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"child tax credit 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"child tax credit 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"OBBBA changes 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"OBBBA changes 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"tip deduction 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"tip deduction 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"overtime deduction 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"overtime deduction 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"senior deduction 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"senior deduction 2026\"}],\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\"]}]]}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\"]}]\n5:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Author: Rachel Mitchell\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-5 sm:p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\",\"alt\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\",\"width\":48,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"href\":\"/about#rachel-mitchell\",\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\",\"children\":\"CPA\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[\"Lead Tax Analyst & Editorial Director\",\", TheTaxCalc\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell is a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) licensed in Illinois with over 12 years of experience in individual and small-business taxation. She specializes in federal and state income tax compliance, FICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3 w-3 text-emerald-500/60\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5\"}]}],\"Reviewed: January 2026\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Tax data verified against IRS Publication 15-T & state revenue departments\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\",\"children\":\"Try Our Tax Calculators\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"See exactly how much you'll take home after all taxes and deductions.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"href\":\"/paycheck-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Paycheck Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"href\":\"/illinois-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"IL Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"href\":\"/texas-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"TX Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"href\":\"/florida-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"FL Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"href\":\"/self-employment-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Self-Employment\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"href\":\"/relocation-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Compare States\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"href\":\"/salary\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounde